--------------------------------
The original CREST file src/signal.c carries the historical header
"taken from the internet" and did not include a per-file license header.
It is included here because it is part of the upstream CREST 3.0.2 source
used by this fork. The local additions in that file are released under
LGPL-3.0-or-later. For a formal legal review, confirm the provenance of
the original pre-CREST snippet with the upstream maintainers before
publishing a binary distribution.

